{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2021-02-02 07:00:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ AGREES TO SELL U.S. FIXED INCOME BUSINESS TO TRADEWEB MARKETS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 02, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ, INC. (NASDAQ: NDAQ) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS U.S. FIXED INCOME BUSINESS, NASDAQ FIXED INCOME (NFI), TO AN AFFILIATE OF TRADEWEB MARKETS INC. (NASDAQ: TW), A LEADING GLOBAL OPERATOR OF ELECTRONIC MARKETPLACES FOR RATES, CREDIT, EQUITIES AND MONEY MARKETS.'}